OL,3,GNEWSASelf-driving grocery robots could
OL,4,Ahit streets soon
OL,5,
OL,6,FSelf-driving robots could soon be
OL,7,Fdelivering groceries across three
OL,8,Fcoastal towns.
OL,10,FThe autonomous electric vehicles would
OL,11,Fbe used in Bournemouth, Christchurch
OL,12,Fand Poole as part of a new pilot scheme
OL,13,Foutlined in BCP Council's latest
OL,14,Ftransport plan, with a target delivery
OL,15,Fdate of 2031.
OL,17,FThey have been described as "tiny
OL,18,Ffridges on wheels" and are already in
OL,19,Foperation in several other parts of the
OL,20,FUK.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
