OL,3,GNEWSASelf-driving grocery robots could
OL,4,Ahit streets soon
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Hadley, the council's cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for climate response,
OL,8,Fenvironment and energy, said the
OL,9,Fauthority was in talks with a company
OL,10,Fand that people in the area could
OL,11,Fexpect to see the robots "within the
OL,12,Fnext year or so".
